      "content": "The high-pitched whistling or whining sound you're hearing is likely related to the supercharger compressor and/or the cooling system. The compressor itself can create a whistling noise due to the high-speed rotation of the blades pushing air. Additionally, the intercooler (if present in the turbocharged system), which cools the compressed air before it enters the combustion chamber, can also make a whistling sound as the coolant flows through its passages and exchanges heat with the compressed air. This involves not just the air moving but also liquids, which contribute to the overall noise.",
